        {
          "text": "Aabbahaa iyo hooyadaa u maamuus sidii Rabbiga Ilaahaaga ahu kugu amray, in cimrigaagu dheeraado, oo aad ku nabdoonaatid dalka Rabbiga Ilaahaaga ahu ku siiyo.",
