              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erayadaas wuxuu Rabbigu, isagoo buurta jooga, dab iyo daruur iyo gudcur qaro weyn dhexdooda shirkiinna oo dhan kagala hadlay cod weyn, wax kalena kuma uu darin. Oo wuxuu ku qoray laba loox oo dhagax ah, markaasuu i siiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaad codka ka dhex maqasheen gudcurka, iyadoo buurta dab ka qaxmayo, ayaad ii soo dhowaateen idinkoo ah madaxdii qabiilooyinkiinna iyo duqowdiinnii oo dhanba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxaad tidhaahdeen, Bal eega, Rabbiga Ilaaheenna ahu wuxuu ina tusay ammaantiisa iyo weynaantiisa, codkiisiina waynu ka maqalnay dabka dhexdiisa, oo maanta waxaan ogaannay in Rabbigu dadka la hadlo oo uu isagu nool yahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba bal maxaynu u leennahay inaynu dhimanno? Waayo, dabkan weyn baa ina baabbi'inaya, oo haddaynu sii maqalno codka Rabbiga Ilaaheenna ah waynu dhimanaynaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, binu-aadmiga oo dhan bal yaa weligiis codka Ilaaha nool oo dabka dhexdiisa ka hadlaya maqlay, sidaan u maqalnay oo kale, oo sii noolaaday? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba adigu u dhowow oo soo maqal kulli waxa Rabbiga Ilaaheenna ahu odhan doono oo dhan, oo noo soo sheeg kulli waxa Rabbiga Ilaaheenna ahu kuu sheegi doono oo dhan, oo annana markaasaannu maqlaynaa oo yelaynaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Rabbigu maqlay codkii erayadiinna markaad ila hadasheen, oo Rabbigu wuxuu igu yidhi, Waan maqlay codkii erayada dadkan, oo ay kugula hadleen, oo wixii ay ku hadleen oo dhan si wanaagsan bay u yidhaahdeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan jeclaan lahaa in qalbi sidaas ahu uu iyaga ku jiro si ay iiga cabsadaan oo ay had iyo goorba u dhawraan amarradayda inay iyaga iyo carruurtooduba weligood nabdoonaadaan! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba u tag oo waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, Teendhooyinkiinnii ku noqda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse adigu waxaad soo istaagtaa halkan agtayda ah, oo anaa kuu sheegaya amarka, iyo qaynuunnada, iyo xukummada aad iyaga bari doontid oo dhan inay ku sameeyaan dalka aan hantida u siinayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba waa inaad dhawrtaan oo u samaysaan sida Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu idiinku amray. Waa inaydaan u leexan xagga midigta iyo xagga bidixda toona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waa inaad ku socotaan jidkii Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu idinku amray oo dhan aad noolaataane inaad nabdoonaataan oo uu cimrigiinnu ku dheeraado dalka aad hantiyi doontaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
